    Mux WOH (#6894)
    
    The Mux WOH should encode multiple tracks into one. The encoding profile
    defines how the streams are handled. With Mux WOH, you can name input
    tracks that will be selected precisely in the encoding profile.
    
    You can test the mux WOH with attached workflow and encoding profiles.
    It expects presenter/source, presentation/source and at least one
    captions/source tracks. Run it from the archive. It will generate and
    archive an download/delivery media file with all presenter, presentation
    media streams and all captions. Do not use it in production, only for
    testing.
    
    
